  "body": "I can reproduce it on a 151 (also on 158 after update) on my Mac. This is likely related to the introduction of the usage of the navigation API by #71504. \n\nCrash report: https://crash-stats.mozilla.org/report/index/e8cfb0f8-3a8b-4b56-a3fc-10dc30261023\n\nEdit: can confirm that I don't reproduce the issue on the 159 beta. ",
